+	/*
+	 * [0x8] System time subseconds in a second (LSBs).
+	 * Resolution is femtoseconds.
+	 *
+	 * Read protocol: This value should not be read by software, since it holds values that are
+	 * less than one CPU cycle (0.26ns)
