+	/*
+	 * [0x10] Clock period in femtoseconds (LSB). Default is according to 375 MHz clock
+	 * frequency
+	 *
+	 * Write protocol: Both clock_period_lsb, and clock_period_msb, are updated upon write to
+	 * clock_period_msb
