+/**** fsm_table_data register ****/
+/*
+ * Flow steering mechanism output selectors:
+ * [1:0] - Input selector:
+ *    00 - 2 tuple, outer header
+ *    01 - 4 tuple, outer header
+ *    10 - 2 tuple. Inner header
+ *    11 - 4 tuple, inner header
